Search a Character in a String

Difficulty: Easy Accuracy: 77.91% Submissions: 77+ Points: 2 Average Time: 5m

Write a program to search for a given character in a string. If the character is found, print the index/position where it first appears in the string.
If the character is not found, print -1.

Problem link :https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/search-a-character-in-a-string/1?page=1&sortBy=latest
*/

class Solution {
    // Function to search for a character in the string
    public int searchCharacter(String s, char ch) {
        // code here
        
        for(int i=0 ; i<s.length() ; i++)
        {
          if(s.charAt(i)==ch)
          {
              return i;
          }
        }
        return -1;
    }
